d  the shd to reconsider the reliance on  the ai  although until changes can be made  agents are still required to utilize it  in order to keep most of their basic  functions and technology active  this could lead to several events where  agents are forced to rely on their  intuition rather than what is being  relayed through the earpiece and scantic  lenses  while all of this is happening vitaly  has finally begun work on the bioreactor  working towards the mass production of  the antivirals  the now minor factions of true suns  outcasts hyenas and even the cleaners  and ruckers will continue to play a  small part in the story as the black  tusk leadership utilized their numbers  to slow down the division  i also think we'll be seeing more of  kina's rogue agents potentially even  another group of non-kinah affiliated  rogues  i suspect we'll be hearing more about  the hunters too not just their  involvement with natalya and the black  tusk but a little more around their  origins as well  however i don't think we'll be learning  everything about them they will continue  to be shrouded in mystery  i by no means think that we'll be seeing  a wrap up of the story in any way  but the story could be at the most  resolved point that we've seen in the  last six years  [Music]  if we can just pop back to the  announcement from the dev team for the  third time in this video  it's worth noting that although they  said they originally planned to end  support this was for the division two  this isn't to say that they were  planning on stopping support for future  additions to the main game  for all we know the division 3 is well  underway but delays have meant that they  have decided to add a few more updates  to the current game  but i don't think this means we'll be  seeing the third installment any time  soon  i'd say it was still at least a couple  of years away  another thing that we need to remember  is that developer trick dempsey not so  long ago was interviewed by ign